WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.975
Unlike fractions have different denominator-sized parts. Find a common denominator

00:00:04.975 --> 00:00:06.408
before combining them.

00:00:07.283 --> 00:00:14.577
Work out 3/4 minus 1/2. The answer is 1/4. Use a common denominator, combine

00:00:14.577 --> 00:00:17.182
numerators and simplify to 1/4.

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:24.250
Two measured lengths in the class garden are 1/2 m and 1/4 m. Find their total. Pause

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:25.713
to choose and explain.

00:00:26.533 --> 00:00:33.847
Two measured lengths in the class garden are 1/2 m and 1/4 m. Find their total. The

00:00:33.847 --> 00:00:39.440
answer is 3/4. Use a common denominator, combine numerators and simplify to 3/4.
